@startuml uc1sequence
title UC1 - document new health problem / new diagnosis - example pyelonephritis
actor Physician
actor Patient
participant "Problem/diagnosis list"
Patient->Physician: Shows fever and pain on left side of abdomen
Physician->Patient: Suspects pyelonepritis
Physician->"Problem/diagnosis list": Appends: Pyelopnehritis (Location: left, Qualifier: suspected)
Physician->Patient: Confirms acute pyelonepritis
Physician->"Problem/diagnosis list": Updates: Pyelopnehritis -> Acute Pyelonephritis
Physician->"Problem/diagnosis list": Updates: (Qualifier: suspected) -> (Qualifier: confirmed)
@enduml